(43196, 543, 543, '<td valign="top">Situations like this are the reason I carry Windex and a squeegee (and a 50'' ladder) in my camera bag at all times.  Hard to miss with a great subject like that.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Situations like this are the reason I carry Windex and a squeegee (and a 50'' ladder) in my camera bag at all times.  Hard to miss with a great subject like that.  Nicely composed.', '2002-04-07 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
