(43272, 551, 102, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I hope for your sake that you either did that on a very sturdy table in a very sealed room, or you taped the cards together...  In any case, it''s a really cool shot just to look at.  It would have been better if it had more global &amp; broad lighting, the flash causes the close cards to become too white and the far cards to recieve just slightly too little light.  It also causes very sharp &amp; attention getting shadows.  Cool shot anyway!</td>', 'Wow.  I hope for your sake that you either did that on a very sturdy table in a very sealed room, or you taped the cards together...  In any case, it''s a really cool shot just to look at.  It would have been better if it had more global & broad lighting, the flash causes the close cards to become too white and the far cards to recieve just slightly too little light.  It also causes very sharp & attention getting shadows.  Cool shot anyway!', '2002-04-01 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
