(43424, 562, 54, '<td valign="top">Very claustrophobic feeling. Makes me never want to live in a big city. Nice variety with the traffic cutting through it all.</td>', 'Very claustrophobic feeling. Makes me never want to live in a big city. Nice variety with the traffic cutting through it all.', '2002-04-02 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
