(43445, 563, 102, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, but the depth of the focus feels like it is on the ground and the nearby trees, instead of the barn itself being in focus.</td>', 'Pretty good, but the depth of the focus feels like it is on the ground and the nearby trees, instead of the barn itself being in focus.', '2002-04-01 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
