(43457, 563, 356, '<td valign="top">Is it just me? Or is the top of the barn bigger than the bottom?  Using the trees to frame works well.  Wasn''t there a movie called "Amityville Horro"?  I am getting little goose bumps now.</td>', 'Is it just me? Or is the top of the barn bigger than the bottom?  Using the trees to frame works well.  Wasn''t there a movie called "Amityville Horro"?  I am getting little goose bumps now.', '2002-04-03 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(43458, 563, 772, '<td valign="top">I like rustic.. this is rustic.. the contrast is excellent and the shadows on the face of the barn give this photo an almost haunted characteristic...</td>', 'I like rustic.. this is rustic.. the contrast is excellent and the shadows on the face of the barn give this photo an almost haunted characteristic...', '2002-04-03 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
