(43535, 573, 820, '<td valign="top">Ok... well... a lot of potential here. For one, I''d prefer to see it in black and white, but that''s subjective so it has no bearing on my vote.<br/><br/>The single thing that really blows it for me is the uncomfortable cropping below the church door. <br/><br/>I hope this wasn''t a snapshot - you have an interesting subject here and should exploit it. Waiting for some defined clouds might be nice too.</td>', 'Ok... well... a lot of potential here. For one, I''d prefer to see it in black and white, but that''s subjective so it has no bearing on my vote.The single thing that really blows it for me is the uncomfortable cropping below the church door. I hope this wasn''t a snapshot - you have an interesting subject here and should exploit it. Waiting for some defined clouds might be nice too.', '2002-04-07 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
