(43703, 584, 127, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject location!  It shows the true meaning of architechure, shape''s, styles''s, angle''s, and color''s/  Just beautiful.<br/></td>', 'Excellent subject location!  It shows the true meaning of architechure, shape''s, styles''s, angle''s, and color''s/  Just beautiful.', '2002-04-06 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(43704, 584, 820, '<td valign="top">Needs level... not photoshop levels, but level.. I''m tilting.<br/></td>', 'Needs level... not photoshop levels, but level.. I''m tilting.', '2002-04-07 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(43705, 584, 357, '<td valign="top">Responses to various comments:<br/>Yes, this a real full-sized place.  It is a swimming pool that is in a fairly dark room, with a small part lit by the skylights.  There''s just an astounding amount of detail in the room as a whole, so the photo actually does represent a study of a small set of details.  At this resolution, the tiles used for the mosaic are about the same size as the pixels at 640x480; the higher resolution shots look a fair bit sharper.  Sorry about the tilt; I was leaning strangely to get the perspective right, and I missed the horizontal.  You can read more about Hearst Castle at //www.hearstcastle.org/.</td>', 'Responses to various comments:Yes, this a real full-sized place.  It is a swimming pool that is in a fairly dark room, with a small part lit by the skylights.  There''s just an astounding amount of detail in the room as a whole, so the photo actually does represent a study of a small set of details.  At this resolution, the tiles used for the mosaic are about the same size as the pixels at 640x480; the higher resolution shots look a fair bit sharper.  Sorry about the tilt; I was leaning strangely to get the perspective right, and I missed the horizontal.  You can read more about Hearst Castle at //www.hearstcastle.org/.', '2002-04-08 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(43706, 585, 245, '<td valign="top">the contrast is too soft for me, the building might work as is if the trees in the background were close to black, right now I''m losing the building in them.</td>', 'the contrast is too soft for me, the building might work as is if the trees in the background were close to black, right now I''m losing the building in them.', '2002-04-01 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(43707, 585, 536, '<td valign="top">I like this old house. My eyes are drawn to the "loft" window, but the choice to go so dark kept me at a distance (if that even makes sense) instead of drawing me in.  There is the potential for a great picture here.</td>', 'I like this old house. My eyes are drawn to the "loft" window, but the choice to go so dark kept me at a distance (if that even makes sense) instead of drawing me in.  There is the potential for a great picture here.', '2002-04-01 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
