(43909, 597, 820, '<td valign="top">Interesting. This has potential, but framing/cropping issues really bug me - the right side of the roof of the church disappears behind the entry roof, the right side of the entry roof disappears just outside the frame, the ? on the lower right is odd, the rock in the foreground is too centered on the stones behind it for me - also the modern buildings peeking up destroy the purity of the whole...<br/><br/>The foreground out of focus also bugs me a bit since there is no real need for limited DOF, except maybe the footprints...</td>', 'Interesting. This has potential, but framing/cropping issues really bug me - the right side of the roof of the church disappears behind the entry roof, the right side of the entry roof disappears just outside the frame, the ? on the lower right is odd, the rock in the foreground is too centered on the stones behind it for me - also the modern buildings peeking up destroy the purity of the whole...The foreground out of focus also bugs me a bit since there is no real need for limited DOF, except maybe the footprints...', '2002-04-07 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
