(44168, 620, 720, '<td valign="top">When you live in a small, run-down, non-architectural (is that even a word?) town like my own, these are the kinds of things you have to resort to, lol. This is very clever, though - you get a 10 from me! I love the buildings in the background, too. Nice contrast.</td>', 'When you live in a small, run-down, non-architectural (is that even a word?) town like my own, these are the kinds of things you have to resort to, lol. This is very clever, though - you get a 10 from me! I love the buildings in the background, too. Nice contrast.', '2002-04-01 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
