(44193, 621, 102, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Only suggestion I have is that (not sure if it would have worked) but you might have been able to get yourself out of the picture if you moved over about 1-2 feet to the right (thus, you would be where the doors meet in the photo and not visible).  But your being visible doesn''t detract from the shot enough for it to matter.  Great shot!</td>', 'Good shot! Only suggestion I have is that (not sure if it would have worked) but you might have been able to get yourself out of the picture if you moved over about 1-2 feet to the right (thus, you would be where the doors meet in the photo and not visible).  But your being visible doesn''t detract from the shot enough for it to matter.  Great shot!', '2002-04-01 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(44194, 621, 308, '<td valign="top">Great colors and detail.  I think that this would have been better if the facade was reflective all across (and didn''t have that non-reflective area on the left), but I know that''s out of your hands.  Still, a very good photo with great colors.</td>', 'Great colors and detail.  I think that this would have been better if the facade was reflective all across (and didn''t have that non-reflective area on the left), but I know that''s out of your hands.  Still, a very good photo with great colors.', '2002-04-01 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
