(44252, 623, 671, '<td valign="top">The black silhouette and the soft buildings make a really nice picture.  To fulfill the "architecture" subject, the buildings probably should have been in focus.  However, to make it a great picture, I am glad you chose to do it this way.</td>', 'The black silhouette and the soft buildings make a really nice picture.  To fulfill the "architecture" subject, the buildings probably should have been in focus.  However, to make it a great picture, I am glad you chose to do it this way.', '2002-05-07 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
