(44284, 624, 279, '<td valign="top">This picture, IMHO, deserved a MUCH higher score. It was a great shot, and if you were trying to illustrate (In part) that the title has too much of an impact on the overall voting, you succeeded.</td>', 'This picture, IMHO, deserved a MUCH higher score. It was a great shot, and if you were trying to illustrate (In part) that the title has too much of an impact on the overall voting, you succeeded.', '2002-04-08 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
